max_completion_tokens = 40
  finish_reason     length
  completion_tokens 40
  ends with         ...'customer. It starts with raw materials, such as wood'

max_completion_tokens = 400
  finish_reason     stop
  completion_tokens 178
  ends with         ...'ffect the final product and the customer experience.'

finish_reason == 'length' means you were cut off, not that the model finished.
Check it. A truncated JSON object will not parse, and Chapter 8 depends on it.
